      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Silver and lead mining once powered Tecopa, then the 1900s Tonopah and Tidewater Railroad connected the town to larger markets.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
