      "category": "economy",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "China Ranch Wash honors Quon Sing, also known as Ah Foo, a Chinese rancher who supplied miners with meat and vegetables around 1900.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
